  "findings": [
    "Ordinary constant-left short circuiting can skip RHS compilation; constant prepass visits both operands first. Warning order and multiplicity agree with the pinned compiler.",
    "Raw selected-child redirects preserve delayed CV/reference reads while ordinary ternary materializes the selected value. Dimension preparation and nested redirects retain exact occurrence identity.",
